---
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';
---
<div class="agent-demo not-content">
  <p class="ag-meta">Works with no API key on slash commands</p>
  <Terminal title="gg autopilot --acp (no API key)" label="A real ACP session: the client sends the find-ceiling slash command and receives a plan, tool calls and a result">
<pre class="wire"><span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>available_commands_update</b>
<span class="dim">     </span>/dry-run  /find-ceiling  /slo-guard
<span class="dim">&rarr; </span><b>session/prompt</b>
<span class="dim">     </span><span class="acc">/find-ceiling api.http max_p99=200 start_rps=30</span>
<span class="dim">     </span><span class="acc">max_rps=300</span>
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>plan</b>       start &middot; watch &middot; report
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>tool_call</b>  start_simulation <span class="dim">mode=find-ceiling</span>
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>tool_call</b>  get_live_telemetry <span class="dim">wait_s=5</span>
<span class="dim">     &times; 12, the last one reports</span> <span class="ok">ceiling_found, 118 RPS</span>
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>tool_call</b>  stop_simulation <span class="dim">report=md</span>
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>agent_message_chunk</b>
<span class="dim">     </span>/find-ceiling on api.http: run finished
<span class="dim">     </span>- ceiling: <b>118 RPS</b> (ceiling_found)
<span class="dim">     </span>- 4847 requests, error rate 0.02%, p50 9 ms
<span class="dim">     </span>- snapshot: .../run-20261117-014920.snap
<span class="dim">&larr; </span><b>stopReason</b>  end_turn</pre>
  </Terminal>

  <p class="caption">Real session captured from <code>gg autopilot --acp</code>: the exact protocol updates the client receives.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .agent-demo { width: 100%; }
  .ag-meta {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .wire { margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; font: inherit; line-height: 1.65; background: none; padding: 0; }
  .agent-demo :global(.term-body) { font-size: 0.74rem; }
  .caption {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
